OL,3,APolice launch criminal investigation
OL,4,Ainto Reform UK donations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police is carrying out
OL,7,Fa criminal investigation into Reform UK
OL,8,Fover allegations it broke foreign
OL,9,Ffunding laws, following a broadcast by
OL,10,FChannel 4 News last week.
OL,12,FAn undercover reporter recorded two
OL,13,Fsenior Reform aides apparently
OL,14,Fsuggesting a way around electoral law
OL,15,Fto secure foreign party donations, one
OL,16,Fof which would have totalled #500,000.
OL,18,FThe police investigation by the Met's
OL,19,FSpecial Enquiry Team is being folded
OL,20,Finto an inquiry that has been under way
OL,21,Finto other donations to the party.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
